  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Bird Song**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **I Haven't Seen Mary In Years**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **I'm Going Back To Old Kentucky**: back after 250 archived shows (1323 days); rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Footprints In The Snow**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Fiddlin' Around**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2020-02-08** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 125 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording sounds good, especially played at high volume [3]\n- **billystrings2020-02-08.mk4v.flac16**: source not stated; 20 songs; 128 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Michael Cleveland played fiddle with the band for the whole show, adding intensity [3]\n- Michael Cleveland sat in on fiddle for the entire show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2020-02-08**: taped by Brain; transferred by Brain; source: AKG C568EB's & MBHO 603a's (hyper cariod capsules)> Sound Devices MixPre-6 [1]\n- **billystrings2020-02-08.mk4v.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (DINa) > kcy > VMS 02ib > Sony M10 (24/48) [2]. Also: Transferred from microSD via Sound Studio and xACT to FLAC at 16-bit/44.1k [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Headliners Music Hall - Louisville, KY - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/headliners-music-hall-louisville-ky-2/) [5]",
